widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Can&#8217;t make it to a studio? Shikha brings the practice to you. Our home yoga sessions are available across South Delhi neighbourhoods including Green Park, Safdarjung Enclave, Lajpat Nagar, Panchsheel Park, and CR Park. Each session is designed around your specific goals \u2014 whether that&#8217;s back pain relief, stress reduction, weight management, or a deeper spiritual practice.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44d07a7 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"44d07a7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cfb522d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cfb522d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why South Delhi Families and Professionals Choose Yoga Inner Power<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b0ed343 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b0ed343\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>10+ years of teaching experience, including international sessions in the USA<\/li><li>Deep understanding of anatomy \u2014 your practice is always safe and personalised<\/li><li>Five yoga styles under one roof: Hatha, Vinyasa, Ashtanga, Kundalini, Yin<\/li><li>Private home sessions available across South Delhi<\/li><li>Trusted by doctors, corporate professionals, homemakers, and seniors alike<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div