e, floor-based holds. Targets deep connective tissues to release tension and cultivate profound stillness and inner quiet. Vinyasa Flow Sync your breath with a fluid dance of dynamic postures. Build heat, strength, and deep inner calm through this moving meditation. The joy of YOGA-From Our Happy Member Real stories that inspire us every day. \u00a0 At our yoga studio, every smile tells a story of peace, balance, and self-discovery. We believe yoga is not just about poses \u2014 it\u2019s about connecting the mind, body, and soul. Watch how our happy members share their journey toward a healthier and more mindful life through yoga. https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/WhatsApp-Video-2025-10-15-at-12.53.37-PM-2.mp4 Yoga Program Times for Begginers Ashtanga Yoga with ALESIA 9:00 AM \u2013 10:00 AM 10:30 AM \u2013 11:30 AM 12:00 PM \u2013 1:00 PM 2:00 PM \u2013 3:00 PM 4:00 PM \u2013 5:00 PM Morning Flow \/ Vinyasa Hatha Yoga \/ Beginners Lunchtime Stretch Gentle Yoga \/ Yin Kids \/ Chair \/ Office Yoga Join Program Kundalini Yoga with GEORGE 2:00 PM \u2013 3:00 PM 4:00 PM \u2013 5:00 PM 5:30 PM \u2013 6:30 PM 7:00 PM \u2013 8:00 PM 12:00 PM \u2013 1:00 PM Power Yoga \/ Intermediate Restorative \/ Yoga Nidra Weekend Flow \/ Mixed Level Gentle Yoga \/ Yin Aerial or AcroYoga (if offered) Join Program Restorative Yoga with HANNAH 9:00 AM \u2013 10:00 AM 10:30 AM \u2013 11:30 AM 12:00 PM \u2013 1:00 PM 2:00 PM \u2013 3:00 PM 4:00 PM \u2013 5:00 PM Chakra \/ Breathwork Class Family or Partner Yoga Kids \/ Chair \/ Office Yoga Yin + Sound Bath Yoga Nidra \/ Meditation Join Program Expert Yoga Classes in South Delhi \u2014 Heal. Empower. Transform. Welcome to Yoga Inner Power \u2014 South Delhi&#8217;s most trusted yoga studio, led by Shikha Arya. Whether you&#8217;re dealing with chronic back pain, burnout, anxiety, or simply want to feel stronger and more at peace in your body, you&#8217;ve found the right place. Shikha brings over a decade of experience, a deep grounding in anatomy, and the full spectrum of yogic wisdom to every class she teaches. Private sessions, group classes, and home visits are available across South Delhi \u2014 including Hauz Khas, Greater Kailash, Vasant Kunj, Defence Colony, and Saket. Yoga Styles We Offer in South Delhi Every body is different. Every journey is personal. That&#8217;s why Yoga Inner Power offers five distinct yoga styles \u2014 so you find the practice that truly fits your life. From the grounding stillness of Hatha Yoga to the energising flow of Vinyasa, the discipline of Ashtanga, the spiritual awakening of Kundalini, and the deep release of Yin Yoga \u2014 there&#8217;s a path here for you, wherever you&#8217;re starting from. Private Yoga Sessions \u2014 At Your Home in South Delhi Can&#8217;t make it to a studio? Shikha brings the practice to you. Our home yoga sessions are available across South Delhi neighbourhoods including Green Park, Safdarjung Enclave, Lajpat Nagar, Panchsheel Park, and CR Park. Each session is designed around your specific goals \u2014 whether that&#8217;s back pain relief, stress reduction, weight management, or a deeper spiritual practice. Why South Delhi Families and Professionals Choose Yoga Inner Power 10+ years of teaching experience, including international sessions in the USA Deep understanding of anatomy \u2014 your practice is always safe and personalised Five yoga styles under one roof: Hatha, Vinyasa, Ashtanga, Kundalini, Yin Private home sessions available across South Delhi Trusted by doctors, corporate professionals, homemakers, and seniors alike Whispers of the Breath Transform Your Space into a Sanctuary of Strength &amp; Serenity Tired of commuting? Want a practice that fits perfectly into your life?\u00a0Yoga Inner Power now brings expert-led yoga directly to your home!\u00a0Enjoy fully personalized sessions in the comfort and privacy of your own space, guided by Shikha Arya\u2019s unique blend of medical insight and yogic wisdom. Ready to Begin Your Home Yoga Journey? +91 96602 16537 Breathe , Move , Transform https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/WhatsApp-Video-2025-10-09-at-12.54.45-PM.mp4https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/WhatsApp-Video-2025-10-09-at-12.54.36-PM.mp4https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/WhatsApp-Video-2025-10-09-at-12.54.50-PM-1.mp4https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/WhatsApp-Video-2025-10-10-at-6.02.45-AM-2.mp4 Move with Intention. Live with Presence. True transformation begins when we shift from automatic motion to Conscious Movement. This is the practice of bringing full, present-moment awareness to every breath and every posture, transforming your physical practice into a moving meditation. It is this profound quality of attention that becomes the catalyst for an Awakened Life\u2014a life lived with greater clarity, purpose, and vibrant connection to yourself and the world around<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_canvas","meta":{"_joinchat":[],"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-1793","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1793","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1793"}],"version-history":[{"count":84,"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1793\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2310,"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1793\/revisions\/2310"}],"wp:attachmen